Package: hubabox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: HubaBox contributors <https://github.com/kros/hubabox>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_KB@
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/kros/hubabox
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Description: LAN-first file hub (browser UI)
 One machine on your network runs this hub; use a browser for admin uploads
 and an optional read-only library for guests. Default HTTP port 8787;
 data under /var/lib/hubabox. After install: http://127.0.0.1:8787/setup
